# astarot
===
 ASTAROT is a Speech, Translation, Accessibility, Revoicing & OCR Toolkit. Real-time speech recognition, translation, text-to-speech and voice conversion for voice chat in VRChat and beyond, with caption overlays and local on-device models on Windows and Linux..
